OHOS: don't select a tab on the close button's mouse-up

A tap can deliver its mouse-up to the tab item even after the × has closed
the tab. The item's handler fell through to tab.select with a deleted id,
which surfaced as a bottom-right "tab.select failed / no such tab" toast.

